{"availability":"available","full":"MakwanaOm1615/LearnLens-AI-Community-Edition","name":"LearnLens-AI-Community-Edition","description":"AI-powered educational assistant that lets users upload videos, documents, or authorized course links to chat with learning materials, generate summaries, flashcards, quizzes, and semantic insights using Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG).","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-25T06:56:09Z","updated":"2026-06-25T14:17:58Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Omverse/rag-ai-assistant","topics":["ai-learning","artificial-intelligence","chromadb","education","gemini-api","generative-ai","gradio","langchain","llm","python","rag","retrieval-augmented-generation","vector-database","whisper"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Omverse/rag-ai-assistant","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:03.721Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:03.721Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:03.721Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T22:34:03.721Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["LearnLens AI (Version 1 - Community Edition) is a production-quality open-source AI learning platform. Instead of chatting with a hardcoded document, LearnLens AI allows anyone to upload their own educational content—whether it's an MP4 Video Lecture, a PDF Textbook, a DOCX Study Guide, or a Text Transcript—and instantly transforms it into a highly intelligent, interactive AI Tutor.","It leverages a powerful modular architecture built on LangChain, Faster Whisper, and ChromaDB to enable semantic search, smart timeline navigation, and automated learning tools (like flashcards and quizzes)."],"features":["Multi-Format Ingestion: Seamlessly upload .mp4, .pdf, .docx, and .txt files.","Smart Video Timeline: Ask a question, and the AI generates a clickable timeline that seeks your video player to the exa